  "//natural": "A NIP: biteRadius 1.0 x gore.biteRadius is a 0.17..0.42-voxel hole -- three or four of a human's art voxels across (owner 2026-10-11: 0.7 still read as too small) -- for 4 hp at full speed. No mouthful, and NO blunt: a blunt share stamps a bruise about a voxel across on every nip, which swamped the hole and made a shoal read as a beating (owner, 2026-10-11). `carrion` 3.17: in a CORPSE the hole is 3.17x as wide (32 times the meat, owner 2026-10-11: 4x what x2 took); `push` 0.1: a nip shoves a body a tenth as hard as a sword's reaction would -- a dead body does not pull away, and at a nip's size a shoal would take half an hour to strip a man to the bone.",
